	(gr_text "RR-HEAD-ACQ  Detector-head acquisition board   rev A   2026-11-26   RR-EL-0103\n\nFABRICATION NOTES\n1. Material FR-4, Tg >= 150 C, 6 copper layers, finished thickness 1.60 mm +/-10 %.\n2. Outer copper 35 um (1 oz) finished; inner copper 17.5 um (0.5 oz).\n3. Min track / space 0.15 / 0.15 mm.  Min finished hole 0.30 mm.  Min annular ring 0.13 mm.\n4. Surface finish ENIG.  Solder mask both sides, vias tented.  Silkscreen both sides.\n5. Board outline per layer Edge.Cuts, tolerance +/-0.1 mm.  Outline 326.00 x 96.00 mm.\n6. Drill / pick-and-place origin = board origin, marked + on this drawing (Y axis up).\n7. Electrical test 100 % against the supplied Gerber netlist data.\n\nSTACKUP (top to bottom, mm)\n   F.Cu 0.035 (signal, components)\n   prepreg FR-4 0.1000\n   In1.Cu 0.0152 (GND plane)\n   core FR-4 0.1500\n   In2.Cu 0.0152 (signal)\n   prepreg FR-4 0.9692\n   In3.Cu 0.0152 (power plane (split))\n   core FR-4 0.1500\n   In4.Cu 0.0152 (GND plane)\n   prepreg FR-4 0.1000\n   B.Cu 0.035 (signal, no components)\n\nHOLE TABLE (finished sizes, mm)\n   dia      type   qty   use\n   0.3      PTH    904   \n   0.5      PTH    64    \n   0.991    NPTH   3     \n   1.02     PTH    14    \n   2.7      PTH    8     \n   3.0      NPTH   4     \n   (904 of the plated holes are vias)"
		(at 392 150 0)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
		(uuid "230c9e67-91ba-473b-91e0-211bec8afd21")
